---
title: "redeem - Withdraw from Lending Pool (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version_check: check version matches
    q_version_check --> q_validate_market: version valid
    q_version_check --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: revert

    q_validate_market --> q_check_mcoin: load market state
    q_check_mcoin --> q_error_too_small: market_coin.value too small
    q_error_too_small --> [*]: revert 2050

    q_check_mcoin --> q_accrue_interest: market_coin.value valid
    q_accrue_interest --> q_calc_exchange: compound_interest(market, clock)
    q_calc_exchange --> q_calc_redeem: exchange_rate = total_supply / total_market_coin
    q_calc_redeem --> q_check_liquidity: redeem_amount = market_coin.value * exchange_rate
    q_check_liquidity --> q_check_reserve: pool_available >= redeem_amount
    q_check_liquidity --> q_error_liquidity: pool liquidity insufficient
    q_error_liquidity --> [*]: revert 81921

    q_check_reserve --> q_update_pool: reserve sufficient
    q_check_reserve --> q_error_reserve: reserve not enough
    q_error_reserve --> [*]: revert 81924

    q_update_pool --> q_burn_scoin: pool.total_supply -= redeem_amount
    q_burn_scoin --> q_emit: pool.total_market_coin -= market_coin.value
    q_emit --> [*]: emit RedeemEvent, return Coin of redeem_amount

    note right of q_calc_exchange
        INV-001: exchange_rate >= 1.0 (monotonically increasing)
        INV-002: redeem_amount >= market_coin.value (user always gets back at least deposited value)
    end note

    note right of q_update_pool
        INV-003: pool.total_supply after = pool.total_supply before - redeem_amount
        INV-004: pool.total_market_coin after = pool.total_market_coin before - market_coin.value
        INV-005: pool.total_supply >= 0 after redemption
    end note
